<title>ROMANIA: Romanian leu 3,611 to dollar for Dec 3 - BNR.</title>
<headline>Romanian leu 3,611 to dollar for Dec 3 - BNR.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Romania's National Bank (BNR) announced the leu's reference rate at 3,611 to the dollar for December 3.</p>
<p>This reference rate was set on Friday as a weighted average based on daily reports of foreign exchange operators. It is a guidance rate used for statistical accounting purposes.</p>
<p>The leu's reference rate set on Thursday for December 2 is 3,591 to the dollar. It was 3,591 on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
</text>
